      "side": 1,
      "message": "Matt,\n\nThank you for the patch and the very detailed, clear explanation. We will be happy to take this patch. Just one question: Did you consider just using the range lock? I\u0027m being lazy, and haven\u0027t analyzed every path, but it looks like it might be just as good.\n\nThanks,\n\nPaul",
      "revId": "0ee43711aad9fe3feecd0c15ec20935924b3066b",
